fui-Badge r1iycov ___172bkpj_b7iz950 f16xkysk faj9fo0 f161y7kd f1c8dzaj f1619yhw f1sl6hi9">Krusgraph builds it</div></div><h3 class="fui-Subtitle2 fui-Text ___i24qii0_1tsayoq fk6fouc fod5ikn faaz57k fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">An API for GraphQL</h3><span class="fui-Body1 fui-Text ___c56hd20_oafdhs0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi figsok6 fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Apps can read the tables with the 7 proven links as relationships, one query per screen.</span><div class="kg-next-actions"><button type="button" aria-label="Dry run: An API for GraphQL" class="fui-Button r1f29ykk"><span class="fui-Button__icon rywnvv2 ___963sj20_1qpm2bl f1nizpg2"><svg fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-fui-icon="" class="fui-Icon ___9ctc0p0_1xvj9ao f1w7gpdv fez10in f1dd5bof" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.22 8.69a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 2.62l-10 5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5 15.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 7.22 3.2zm-.48 1.75a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.88l-10-5.5A.5.5 0 0 0 6 4.5v11c0 .38.4.62.74.44z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span>Dry run</button></div></li><li class="kg-next-card" data-step="iq"><div class="kg-next-head"><span class="krusgraph-item-title kg-next-workload"><img class="krusgraph-item-icon" src="/assets/fabric-icons/ontology_24_item.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20"/><span class="fui-Caption1 fui-Text ___13vod6f_1082073 fk6fouc fy9rknc fwrc4pm figsok6 fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Fabric IQ · Ontology</span></span><div class="fui-Badge r1iycov ___172bkpj_b7iz950 f16xkysk faj9fo0 f161y7kd f1c8dzaj f1619yhw f1sl6hi9">Krusgraph builds it</div></div><h3 class="fui-Subtitle2 fui-Text ___i24qii0_1tsayoq fk6fouc fod5ikn faaz57k fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">An ontology (preview)</h3><span class="fui-Body1 fui-Text ___c56hd20_oafdhs0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi figsok6 fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">6 tables with a proven key become entity types, and the 7 proven links the relationships between them.</span><div class="kg-next-actions"><button type="button" aria-label="Dry run: An ontology (preview)" class="fui-Button r1f29ykk"><span class="fui-Button__icon rywnvv2 ___963sj20_1qpm2bl f1nizpg2"><svg fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-fui-icon="" class="fui-Icon ___9ctc0p0_1xvj9ao f1w7gpdv fez10in f1dd5bof" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.22 8.69a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 2.62l-10 5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5 15.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 7.22 3.2zm-.48 1.75a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.88l-10-5.5A.5.5 0 0 0 6 4.5v11c0 .38.4.62.74.44z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span>Dry run</button></div></li><li class="kg-next-card" data-step="app"><div class="kg-next-head"><span class="krusgraph-item-title kg-next-workload"><img class="krusgraph-item-icon" src="/assets/fabric-icons/fabric_apps_24_item.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20"/><span class="fui-Caption1 fui-Text ___13vod6f_1082073 fk6fouc fy9rknc fwrc4pm figsok6 fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Apps · App</span></span><div class="fui-Badge r1iycov ___172bkpj_b7iz950 f16xkysk faj9fo0 f161y7kd f1c8dzaj f1619yhw f1sl6hi9">Krusgraph builds it</div></div><h3 class="fui-Subtitle2 fui-Text ___i24qii0_1tsayoq fk6fouc fod5ikn faaz57k fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">A Rayfin App (preview)</h3><span class="fui-Body1 fui-Text ___c56hd20_oafdhs0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi figsok6 fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Its list pages and key figures are built over a read-only connector with the 7 proven links.</span><span class="fui-Caption1 fui-Text ___13vod6f_1082073 fk6fouc fy9rknc fwrc4pm figsok6 fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Create makes an empty App item and a package with one command; the App opens inside Fabric only.</span><div class="kg-next-actions"><button type="button" aria-label="Dry run: A Rayfin App (preview)" class="fui-Button r1f29ykk"><span class="fui-Button__icon rywnvv2 ___963sj20_1qpm2bl f1nizpg2"><svg fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-fui-icon="" class="fui-Icon ___9ctc0p0_1xvj9ao f1w7gpdv fez10in f1dd5bof" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.22 8.69a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 2.62l-10 5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5 15.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 7.22 3.2zm-.48 1.75a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.88l-10-5.5A.5.5 0 0 0 6 4.5v11c0 .38.4.62.74.44z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span>Dry run</button></div></li></ul></section>"
